# Cloudflare Pages rejects a deploy containing any single asset over 25 MiB
# (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/platform/limits/). The .deb
# packages under pool/ blow past that -- mezite_0.2.24_amd64.deb alone is
# ~34.7 MB -- so pool/ is excluded from the Pages build (see build-pages.sh)
# and served straight from GitHub Pages instead.
#
# `Filename:` in dists/stable/main/binary-*/Packages is repo-relative
# ("pool/pkg_ver_arch.deb"), and apt follows HTTP redirects, so this split
# is invisible to `apt install` -- see README.md for the full picture.
/pool/*  https://leonardaustin.github.io/apt.hitoric.com/pool/:splat  302
